  "body": "Set on a 536sqm freehold site, this stunning 332sqm brand-new home offers impressive scale, sophisticated design and elevated sea views in sought-after Long Bay.\r\n\r\nA dramatic high-stud entrance and statement chandelier set the tone from the moment you arrive.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms and 3 master suites, the flexible layout is ideal for modern or extended families. The ground-floor master has its own entrance, while multiple living areas provide plenty of space for everyone.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a designer kitchen with a large island and walk-in pantry, flowing effortlessly to the landscaped outdoor area. A separate lounge with fireplace adds warmth and elegance.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a spacious second living area with beverage bar opens to a sunny balcony with beautiful sea views.\r\n\r\nBrand new and backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, offering added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nBeautifully designed. Generous in every way.\r\n\r\nJust a stroll from Long Bay Beach, cafés and the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCall Rachel today to make it yours.",
